you take the product

35
00:03:03,420 --> 00:03:05,820
and you take the
derivative, that

36
00:03:05,820 --> 00:03:09,340
exists and is equal to the
derivative of the first times

37
00:03:09,340 --> 00:03:16,340
the second plus the first times
the derivative of the second.

38
00:03:16,340 --> 00:03:20,150
And then the fourth of
these was the quotient rule.

39
00:03:25,820 --> 00:03:28,080
And the quotient rule
was that you have,

40
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,660
